  "description": "<p>Restore the fcr:batch REST endpoint for doing batch operations.  This would be particularly helpful for reducing the number requests necessary to build complex objects, which should improve performance and concurrent editing robustness.</p>\n\n<p>The last release of Fedora that had the fcr:batch functionality was 4.0.0-beta-03: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-4.0.0-beta-03/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraBatch.java\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/fcrepo-4.0.0-beta-03/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraBatch.java</a></p>",
